{"message":"Let’s start by ensuring your phone is on a modern network. Please perform the action:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred").

Let me know once you’ve done that, and we’ll move to the next step."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please toggle Wi-Fi Calling off by performing the action:

toggle_wifi_calling()

Let me know when that’s done."}

{"message":"Thanks! Now please grant the messaging app SMS permission by performing the action:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="sms")

Let me know once that’s completed."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please toggle your mobile data on by performing the action:

toggle_data()

Let me know once that’s done, and we’ll proceed to the next step."}

{"message":"I’ve added 2 GB of data to your line. Next, please reseat your SIM card by performing the action:

reseat_sim_card()

Let me know once you’ve done that."}

{"message":"Let’s verify your APN settings for MMS. Please run the action:

check_apn_settings()

and share the results you see, especially the MMSC URL."}

{"message":"Please grant the storage permission to the messaging app first by performing the action:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="storage")

Let me know once that’s completed, and then we’ll reboot your device."}

{"message":"Yes, please reboot your device by performing the action:

reboot_device()

Let me know when your device has rebooted."}

{"message":"Let’s take one more look at your network setup. Please run the action:

check_network_status()

and share the full results you see. This will help us pinpoint any remaining issues."}

{"message":"Please enable Data Roaming by performing the action:

toggle_roaming()

Let me know once that’s done, and we’ll test MMS again."}

{"message":"Let’s run the MMS diagnostic tool. Please perform the action:

can_send_mms()

and share the result you see."}
